{
  "info": {
    "name": "DM GPIO E2E (system-agent)",
    "description": "End-to-end verification of the system-agent GPIO commands through Device Management on a real device (EPC-R7300).\n\nPath under test: DM REST commands:invoke -> command pipeline (catalog gate, connection gate) -> transceiver dispatch -> cloud NATS -> dmagent -> SubNode -> hardware -> result sealed back in DM.\n\nSetup:\n1. Set collection variables: baseUrl, deviceId, accessToken (Bearer token from WiseSso login; e.g. ~/.weda-coding-agent/token.json when using weda-login.sh).\n2. The target device must be online (SubNode heartbeat active) with the GPIO-enabled system-agent build.\n3. Run the collection in order (Collection Runner or newman). Each invoke is followed by a result poll.\n\nCommands covered:\n- gpio.list  (custom command) - expected success, discovers pin names\n- di.get     (built-in)       - expected success, reads input pins by sensor name\n- do.set     (built-in)       - negative path: writing an input pin must fail with executionFailed\n- no.such.cmd                 - negative path: DM catalog gate must fail closed (404)\n\nAuth is embedded: folder \"0. Auth (WiseSso)\" runs the full WiseSso chain and stores accessToken into the ACTIVE ENVIRONMENT, so pick one of the role environments (admin / operator / viewer) before running. The 302 request must not follow redirects (set per-request); run the whole collection in order.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://weda-sit-k3s.weda.dev/central/weda/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "deviceId",
      "value": "48b02dea8160"
    },
    {
      "key": "inputSensor1",
      "value": "gpio_pinState_UIO_GPIO2"
    },
    {
      "key": "inputSensor2",
      "value": "gpio_pinState_CN13_GPIO1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth (WiseSso)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "External Login 302",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.cookies.clear();",
                  "",
                  "const oidcIdentity = pm.environment.get('Identity.Permission');",
                  "console.log('Identity.Permission value:', oidcIdentity);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 302', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));",
                  "// Plain-regex parsing: newman's sandbox has no URL global, so",
                  "// new URL(...) throws there and the captures silently never happen.",
                  "const location = pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '';",
                  "const cid = location.match(/[?&]client_id=([^&]+)/);",
                  "if (cid) pm.environment.set('client_id', decodeURIComponent(cid[1]));",
                  "const ru = location.match(/[?&]redirect_uri=([^&]+)/);",
                  "if (ru) pm.environment.set('redirect_uri', decodeURIComponent(ru[1]));",
                  "const tenant = decodeURIComponent(location).match(/tenantId:([a-f0-9-]+)/i);",
                  "pm.test('tenantId discovered', () => pm.expect(tenant).to.not.be.null);",
                  "if (tenant) pm.environment.set('tenantId', tenant[1]);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {
            "followRedirects": false
          },
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{domain}}/{{tenantPath}}/portal/external-login?returnUrl={{domain}}/{{tenantPath}}/{{appPath}}",
              "host": [
                "{{domain}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{tenantPath}}",
                "portal",
                "external-login"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "returnUrl",
                  "value": "{{domain}}/{{tenantPath}}/{{appPath}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Account Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "const setCookie = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (setCookie && setCookie.includes('Identity.Permission=')) {",
                  "  const cookies = setCookie.split(',');",
                  "  const identityCookie = cookies.find(c => c.includes('Identity.Permission='));",
                  "  if (identityCookie) {",
                  "    const value = identityCookie.split(';')[0].split('=')[1];",
                  "    pm.environment.set('Identity.Permission', value);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  ""
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Cookie",
                "value": "Path=/platform/sso; HttpOnly=true; Secure=true"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{domain}}/{{ssoBaseUrl}}/api/v1.0/account/login",
              "host": [
                "{{domain}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{ssoBaseUrl}}",
                "api",
                "v1.0",
                "account",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "External Login 200",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const oidcIdentity = pm.environment.get('Identity.Permission');",
                  "console.log('Identity.Permission value:', oidcIdentity);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const html = pm.response.text();",
                  "  const actionMatch = html.match(/<form[^>]*action=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"']/i);",
                  "  if (actionMatch) pm.environment.set('form_action', actionMatch[1]);",
                  "  const inputMatches = html.match(/<input[^>]*name=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"'][^>]*value=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"']/gi);",
                  "  if (inputMatches) {",
                  "    inputMatches.forEach(match => {",
                  "      const nameMatch = match.match(/name=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"']/i);",
                  "      const valueMatch = match.match(/value=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"']/i);",
                  "      if (nameMatch && valueMatch) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(nameMatch[1], valueMatch[1]);",
                  "      }",
                  "    });",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Cookie",
                "value": "Identity.Permission={{Identity.Permission}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{domain}}/{{tenantPath}}/portal/external-login?returnUrl={{domain}}/{{tenantPath}}/{{appPath}}",
              "host": [
                "{{domain}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{tenantPath}}",
                "portal",
                "external-login"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "returnUrl",
                  "value": "{{domain}}/{{tenantPath}}/{{appPath}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Signin Oidc",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const loginCookie = pm.cookies.get('AdvOidc.Login');",
                  "if (loginCookie) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('AdvOidc.Login', loginCookie);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {
            "followRedirects": false
          },
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "code",
                  "value": "{{code}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "state",
                  "value": "{{state}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "iss",
                  "value": "{{iss}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{form_action}}",
              "host": [
                "{{form_action}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "WEDA Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('WEDA token issued', () => pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.test('accessToken captured', () => pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const domain = pm.environment.get('domain');",
                  "const tenantPath = pm.environment.get('tenantPath');",
                  "const appPath = pm.environment.get('appPath');",
                  "pm.environment.set('apibaseurl', domain+'/'+tenantPath+'/'+appPath+'/api/v1');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apibaseurl}}/auth/tokens",
              "host": [
                "{{apibaseurl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "tokens"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. DM E2E",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. gpio.list - invoke (custom command)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('invoke accepted (HTTP 202)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('command received (status 0)', () => pm.expect(body.data.status).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.test('phase is pending or result', () => pm.expect(['pending', 'result']).to.include(body.data.phase));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('gpioListSeqId', body.seqId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands:invoke",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands:invoke"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"deviceCommand\":\"gpio.list\",\"parameters\":{}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. gpio.list - result sealed",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "setTimeout(() => {}, 2000);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('results readable (HTTP 200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const seqId = pm.collectionVariables.get('gpioListSeqId');",
                  "const row = pm.response.json().items.find(i => i.seqId === Number(seqId));",
                  "pm.test('command row exists', () => pm.expect(row).to.not.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('phase sealed as result', () => pm.expect(row.data.phase).to.eql('result'));",
                  "pm.test('device executed successfully (status 0)', () => pm.expect(row.data.status).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.test('executedAt / completedAt sealed', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(row.data.executedAt).to.not.be.null;",
                  "  pm.expect(row.data.completedAt).to.not.be.null;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/results",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands",
                "results"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. di.get - invoke (built-in, sensor-name addressing)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('invoke accepted (HTTP 202)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('command received (status 0)', () => pm.expect(body.data.status).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('diGetSeqId', body.seqId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands:invoke",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands:invoke"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"deviceCommand\":\"di.get\",\"parameters\":{\"inputs\":[\"{{inputSensor1}}\",\"{{inputSensor2}}\"]}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. di.get - result sealed",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "setTimeout(() => {}, 2000);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const seqId = pm.collectionVariables.get('diGetSeqId');",
                  "const row = pm.response.json().items.find(i => i.seqId === Number(seqId));",
                  "pm.test('command row exists', () => pm.expect(row).to.not.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('phase sealed as result', () => pm.expect(row.data.phase).to.eql('result'));",
                  "pm.test('inputs read successfully (status 0)', () => pm.expect(row.data.status).to.eql(0));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/results",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands",
                "results"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. do.set on input pin - refused by direction guard (negative)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('invoke accepted for dispatch (HTTP 202)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('doSetSeqId', pm.response.json().seqId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands:invoke",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands:invoke"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"deviceCommand\":\"do.set\",\"parameters\":{\"outputs\":[{\"name\":\"{{inputSensor1}}\",\"state\":true}]}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. do.set - executionFailed sealed (negative)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "setTimeout(() => {}, 2000);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const seqId = pm.collectionVariables.get('doSetSeqId');",
                  "const row = pm.response.json().items.find(i => i.seqId === Number(seqId));",
                  "pm.test('command row exists', () => pm.expect(row).to.not.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('phase sealed as result', () => pm.expect(row.data.phase).to.eql('result'));",
                  "pm.test('device refused the write (status 1)', () => pm.expect(row.data.status).to.eql(1));",
                  "pm.test('error is executionFailed', () => pm.expect(row.data.error.code).to.eql('executionFailed'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/results",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands",
                "results"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. unknown command - catalog gate fails closed (negative)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('unknown command rejected (404)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('commandNotFound error', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().title).to.eql('commandNotFound'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands:invoke",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "devices",
                "{{deviceId}}",
                "commands:invoke"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"deviceCommand\":\"no.such.cmd\",\"parameters\":{}}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
